@catalog = http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/catalog
@orders  = http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/orders
@orderId = f0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001







### 1. Create an order with 2 items (deep insert)
POST {{orders}}/Orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ID": "{{orderId}}",
  "orderDate": "2026-10-15T12:00:00Z",
  "customer_ID": "a1b2c3d4-0006-4000-8000-000000000006",
  "items": [
    { "ID": "f0000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000a1", "game_ID": "b7e5f1a0-0001-4000-8000-0000000000a4", "quantity": 1 },
    { "ID": "f0000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000a2", "game_ID": "b7e5f1a0-0001-4000-8000-0000000000a5", "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### 2. Check items (expect 2)
GET {{orders}}/Orders({{orderId}})?$expand=items

### 3. Delete the order
DELETE {{orders}}/Orders({{orderId}})

### 4. Order gone (expect 404)
GET {{orders}}/Orders({{orderId}})

### 5. Items gone (expect "value": [])
GET {{orders}}/OrderItems?$filter=order_ID eq {{orderId}}

### 6. Games still exist, via the catalog service (expect 2 rows)
GET {{catalog}}/Games?$filter=ID eq b7e5f1a0-0001-4000-8000-0000000000a4 or ID eq b7e5f1a0-0001-4000-8000-0000000000a5&$select=title







### 1. Alle orders van één klant, met orderregels en titel van elke game (Erin)
GET {{orders}}/Orders?$filter=customer_ID eq a1b2c3d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000003&$expand=items($expand=game($select=title))

### 2. Reviews van één game, met de voornaam van de klant
GET {{catalog}}/Games(b7e5f1a0-0001-4000-8000-0000000000a1)/reviews?$expand=customer($select=firstname)

### 3. Alle games met hun tags (met naam van de tag)
GET {{catalog}}/Games?$select=title&$expand=tags($expand=tag($select=name))

### 4. Zelfde resultaat, rechtstreeks gefilterd op Games
GET {{catalog}}/Games?$filter=tags/any(t:t/tag_code eq 'STORY')&$select=title

### 5a. Order zonder klant (veld customer_ID ontbreekt)
POST {{orders}}/Orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderDate": "2026-10-15T12:00:00Z"
}

### 5b. Order met een klant die niet bestaat
POST {{orders}}/Orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderDate": "2026-10-15T12:00:00Z",
  "customer_ID": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000"
}